HOST: https://api.gospotcheck.com

# GoSpotCheck External API
The GoSpotCheck External API is designed for developers and engineers who are interested in building custom applications or integrating with other APIs.

The API is best suited for:
- Ongoing creates or updates to your people, places, UAPs, catalogs, items, etc
- Pulling MissionResponse or TaskResponse data out of GoSpotCheck to create your own reports

New to GoSpotCheck? Check out the [GSC Glossary](https://support.gospotcheck.com/hc/en-us/articles/202367280-GSC-Glossary) to learn the lingo!

