## Places - Index Fields Filtering [/external/v1/places?place_group_id.eq=7&company_id=2]

The following are all of the fields available to filter and sort Places for
your company. For explanations of field operators, please read the introduction on [Index Filtering](#section-api-requests-index-filtering).

| Field                | Type | Matchers                                   | Example                                   |
|----------------------|------|--------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|
| `name`               | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `name.eq=GSC Headquarters`                |
| `address`            | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `address.eq=1234 Wallace Way`             |
| `city`               | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `city.eq=Denver`                          |
| `state`              | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `state.eq=CO`                             |
| `postal_code`        | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `postal_code.eq=80215`                    |
| `country`            | string         | `.eq`, `.like`, `.ilike`, `.in`            | `country.eq=USA`                          |
| `custom_place_id`    | int            | `.eq`, `.in`                               | `custom_place_id.eq=12`                   |
| `place_group_id`     | int            | `.eq`, `.in`                               | `place_group_id.eq=1`                     |
| `campaign_id`        | int            | `.eq`, `.in`                               | `campaign_id.eq=1`                        |
| `id`                 | int            | `.eq`, `.gt`, `.gte`, `.lt`, `.lte`, `.in` | `id.eq=1`                                 |
| `created_at`         | unix timestamp | `.eq`, `.gt`, `.gte`, `.lt`, `.lte`        | `created_at.eq=1406236435.060687`         |
| `disabled_at`        | unix timestamp | `.eq`, `.gt`, `.gte`, `.lt`, `.lte`        | `disabled_at.eq=1406236435.060687`        |
| `updated_at`         | unix timestamp | `.eq`, `.gt`, `.gte`, `.lt`, `.lte`        | `updated_at.eq=1406236435.060687`         |

The Places index allows you to query for all places that belong to your company,
and includes a wide variety of filtering options to pull places



