# Group PlaceGroups
<a id="group-placegroups-index"></a>
The PlaceGroups endpoint allows you to add,delete, list and update place groups
for your company.

Remember:
- Placegroups are groups of places to which a mission is deployed.
- Places are added to the “All” Placegroup by default.
- Placegroups do not have metadata/properties
- Placegroups cannot be disabled, use caution when deleting a placegroup as this action cannot be undone.

## Placegroups - Base Attributes
| Field                    | Type | Notes   |
|-----------------------------|-----|-----------|
|`id`                     |  int  | Unique GSC id  |
|`name`                     |  string  | Name of placegroup, must be unique |
|`created_at`                     |  datetime  | When placegroup was created in GSC   |
|`updated_at`                     |  datetime  | When placegroup was last updated in GSC |

## Available Includes for PlaceGroups
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- none

## Available Methods for PlaceGroups
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `company_id`

