# Group Users
<a id="group-users-index"></a>
The Users endpoint allows you to add, list and update users for your company.

Remember:
- Users are the people at your company with access to the GoSpotCheck mobile and/or web apps
- Users can be assigned to one or more Teams after they are created
- Users can have multiple company memberships in GoSpotCheck
- Calls will time out after 30 seconds, make sure to set bounds for your calls to get small sections of data at a time.

## Users - Base Attributes
| Field                       | Type     | Notes        | Matchers    | Examples (With Limits) |
|-----------------------------|----------|--------------|-------------|------------------------------|
|`id`                         |  int     | Unique GSC id              | `.eq`, `.in` | `id.eq=1`, `id.in=1,2` |
|`email`                      |  string  | User email, must be unique | `.eq`, `.in`, `.like`, `.ilike` | `email.eq=joe.user@acme.com` |
|`first_name`                 |  string  | First name of the user    | N/A | Not Filterable. |
|`last_name`                  |  string  | Last name of the user     | N/A | Not Filterable. |
|`phone`                      |  string  | Phone number for the user | N/A | Not Filterable. |
|`company_membership_role`    |  string  || `.eq`, `.in` | `company_membership_role.eq=company_manager`, `company_membership_role.in=manager` |
|`created_at`                 | unix timestamp || `.eq`, `.lt`, `.lte`, `.gt`, `.gte` | `created_at.eq=1406236435.060687`, `created_at.lt=1636730822&created_at.gt=1636471622` |
|`updated_at`                 | unix timestamp || `.eq`, `.gt`, `.gte`, `.lt`, `.lte` | `updated_at.eq=1406236435.060687`, `updated_at.lt=1636730822&updated_at.gt=1636471622` |
|`team_id`                    |  int     || `.eq`, `.in` | `team_id.eq=2` |
|`disabled`                   |  `null` or `notnull`  | Status of the user in the company | `.eq` | `disabled.eq=null` |
|`metadata/properties`        |  string  | Custom key/value pairs, key must be created by GSC but values can be pulled from the API |||


## Available Includes for Users
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `teams`
- `user_place_assignments`
- `assigned_places`

## Available Methods for Users
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `team_ids`

## Create Users
NOTE: If you attempt to create a user and receive an “Email has already been taken” error, reach out to your GoSpotCheck Customer Success Manager or support@gospotcheck.com for help with adding these users to the system.

NOTE: We are removing the ability to set passwords when creating or updating users. Newly created users must be sent an invitation email through the admin interface or go through the password reset flow on the sign in screen.
The following attributes are permitted when creating a User. All other attributes will be ignored.

| Field                    | Type           | Required    | Notes|
|--------------------------|----------------|-------------|--------|
|`email`                   | string         | Yes         ||
|`first_name`              | string         | Yes         ||
|`last_name`               | string         | Yes         ||
|`phone`                   | string         | No          ||
|`send_user_invitation`    | boolean        | No          | Sends the user an email to use GoSpotCheck, defaults to `false` unless explicitly set to `true`|

