#### Get User Company Permissions
##### [/external/v1/users/{id}/permissions]

This endpoint allows for viewing of a requested user's permissions. The given id
may be an integer or "me" like the above method to view your own permissions. Possible
roles that may be returned are as follows:
- company_admin
- company_manager
- company_user

This endpoint also returns whether or not a user is disabled.

**Note:** Only GoSpotcheck admin users or company_admin users may view permissions
for users other than themselves.

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer 1234567890abcdef

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "request": {
                "status_code": 200,
                "status_message": "OK",
                "path": "/external/v1/users/84/permissions",
                "method": "GET",
                "format": "json",
                "params": {}
            },
            "data": {
                "role": "company_user",
                "disabled": "false",
                "disabled_at": null,
                "company_id": 1
            }
        }

