# Group Teams
<a id="group-teams-index"></a>
The Teams endpoint allows you to add, delete, list and update teams
for your company.

Remember:
- Teams are groups of people to which you deploy missions.
- Users are added to the “All” Team by default.
- Teams do not have metadata/properties.
- Teams cannot be disabled, use caution when deleting a team as this action cannot be undone.

## Teams - Base Attributes
| Field                    | Type | Notes   |
|-----------------------------|-----|-----------|
|`id`                     |  int  | Unique GSC id  |
|`name`                     |  string  | Name of team, must be unique |
|`created_at`                     |  datetime  | When team was created in GSC   |
|`updated_at`                     |  datetime  | When team was last updated in GSC |


## Available Includes for Teams
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `team_members`

## Available Methods for Teams
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `company_id`

