# Group Tasks
<a id="group-mission-tasks-index"></a>
After creating the mission, the mission ID can be used to create tasks and/or sections for the mission.



## Create [/external/v1/missions/{mission_id}/tasks]

Remember:
- Tasks exist in Sections, which exist in Missions.
- TaskResponses are the answer for a task from a user in the mobile app.
- TaskResponses sit inside MissionResponses
- More about Tasks in our [Help Center](https://support.gospotcheck.com/hc/en-us/articles/202249884-Task-Types)

## Tasks - Base Attributes
| Field                    | Type | Notes   |
|-----------------------------|-----|-----------|
|`id`                     |  int  | Unique GSC id  |
|`type`                     |  string  | Task type - e.g. Yes/No |
|`title`                     |  string  | Name of task, not unique |
|`description`                     |  string  | Open text field for displaying instructions to users in the mobile app for the task |
|`optional`                     |  boolean  | Whether or not a task is required in the mobile app to submit mission response |
|`configuration`                     |  array  | Array of values that a user in the mobile app could select for the task - only applies to yes/no, multiple select and multiple choice |
|`campaign_id`                     |  int  | Campaign/mission id to which the task belongs |
|`parent_task_id`                     |  int  | Only applicable to a child/conditional task with a parent task |
|`parent_task_value`                     |  string  | Indicates the value that must be selected to result in the child task |
|`section_id`                     |  int  |  Section (grouping of tasks) id to which the task belongs |
|`version_identifier`                     |  int  | Unique identifier to link tasks between multiple versions of a mission together |
|`version_number`                     |  int  | Version of the task, always 1 unless mission in which the tasks exists has been versioned |
|`created_at`                     |  datetime  | When task was last updated in GSC |
|`updated_at`                     |  datetime  | When task was last updated in GSC |
|`metadata/properties`                     |  string  | Custom key/value pairs, key must be created by GSC but values can be pulled from the API |
|`distribution_percentage`                 |  int  | How often, as a percentage, the task will appear in the mission |

## Available Includes for Tasks
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- NONE

## Available Methods for Tasks
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- NONE

### Create tasks and subtasks [POST]

The following attributes are permitted when creating a Task, depending on type. All other attributes will be ignored.

| Field                                     | Type           | Required                                         |Options
|-------------------------------------------|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|---------------------
| `type`                                    | string         | Yes                                              |Count, Date, MultipleChoice, MultipleSelect, Price, Picture, Scale, ShortAnswer, SearchableList, Temperature, YesNo
| `title`                                   | string         | Yes                                              |
| `description`                             | string         | No                                               |
| `optional`                                | boolean        | No - Defaults to required                        |
| `parent_task_value`                       | string         | Yes - When it is a subtask (unless subtask of SearchableList)| Do not provide a `parent_task_value` for tasks whose Parent is a SearchableList type
| `choices`                                 | string         | Yes - For types MultipleChoice/MultipleSelect    |
| `currency`                                | string         | No - For type Price, defaults to USD             |3 Letter currency codes
| `default_value`                           | int            | No - For type Count                              |
| `left`                                    | int            | Yes - For type Scale                             |
| `right`                                   | int            | Yes - For type Scale                             |
| `left_description`                        | string         | Yes - For type Scale                             |
| `right_description`                       | string         | Yes - For type Scale                             |
| `tasks`                                   | Task attributes| No                                               | An array of sub-task attribute hashes
| `max_photos`                              | int            | No                                               | Accepts values of 1 - 100 (Default = 3)
| `camera_only`                             | boolean        | No                                               | True/False (Default = False)
| `hifi_photo_config_id`                    | string         | Yes - For an Image Rec-enabled Picture task      | Must be a valid HiFi config ID. Check with your CSM for this information.
| `unit_of_measure`                         | string         | No - For type Temperature                        | Must be "F" for Fahrenehit or "C" for Celsius (Default = "F")
| `catalog_id`                              | int            | Yes - For type SearchableList                    | Must be a valid catalog_id in the mission company
| `max_items`                               | int            | No - For type SearchableList                     | Defaults to unlimited item selections
| `scan_type`                               | string: `"barcode"` or `"qr"`| No - For type QuickScan            | Defaults to `"barcode"`
| `scan_editing_enabled`                    | boolean        | No - For type QuickScan                          | Defaults to false
| `manual_entry_enabled`                    | boolean        | No - For type QuickScan                          | Defaults to false
| `info_url`                                | string         | No                       |


+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer 1234567890abcdef

    + Body

