## Tasks [/external/v1/missions/{mission_id}/tasks/{id}]

### Update an existing Task [PUT]

**Note:** Tasks may only be updated when the Mission is in 'draft' state.

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer 1234567890abcdef

    + Body

            {
                description: "Describe it",
            }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

        {
            "request": {
                "status_code": 200,
                "status_message": "Task id 6 updated successfully",
                "path": "/external/v1/missions/1/tasks/6",
                "method": "PUT",
                "format": "json",
                "params": {}
            },
            "data": {
                "id": 6,
                "type": "Task::Scale",
                "title": "Rate the soup",
                "description": "Describe it",
                "optional": false,
                "position": 4,
