# Group UserPlaceAssignments
<a id="group-userplaceassignments-index"></a>
The UserPlaceAssignments endpoint allows you to add, delete, and list user place assignments
for your company.

Remember:
- User Place Assignments are also known as User Assigned Places or UAPs for short
- UAPs allow you to distribute msisions to users only at their assigned accounts/places
- UAPs can only be created or deleted, there is no update or disable

## UserPlaceAssignments - Base Attributes
| Field                    | Type | Notes   |
|-----------------------------|-----|-----------|
|`id`                     |  bigint (64bit)  | Unique GSC id  |
|`user_id`                     |  int  | Unique GSC id of user that is assigned to the place |
|`place_id`                     |  int  | Unique GSC id of the place assigned to the user |
|`created_at`                     |  datetime  | When UAP was created in GSC   |
|`updated_at`                     |  datetime  | When UAP was last updated in GSC |

## Available Includes for UserPlaceAssignments
For more info, see: [Includes & Methods](#section-includes-methods)

- `place`
- `user`

## UserPlaceAssignments [/external/v1/user_place_assignments]

