# Group Async Jobs
<a id="group-async-jobs-status"></a>
The Async Jobs endpoint allows you to query the status of your queued, running, completed or expired asynchronous jobs.
The `job_guid` required to request status is returned from your requests that are queued asynchronously on enabled endpoints.
For more information on requesting asynchronous jobs, see section [Asynchronous CSV Jobs](#section-async-jobs).



