      "prices": [],
      "segment_index": 0,
      "shelf_index_x": 0,
      "shelf_index_y": 0,
      "size": "32.00 oz",
      "stack_index": 0,
      "subclassification": "Lager",
      "supplier": "GoSpotCheck",
      "unit_facing": 1,
      "upc": "123"
    }
  }]
}
```

**Return Example Body (with tag edits)**
```
{
  "tags": [
    {
      "id": 700841324,
      "type": "coldbox_unrecognizable_product",
