    { "x": 11.11, "y": 64.89, "z": 0, "upc": "000000000009", "depth": 18, "width": 7.44,  "height": 9.57,  "dFacings": 1, "excluded": false, "hFacings": 2, "vFacings": 1, "StackIndex": 0, "locationId": "2",  "orientation": "front_back", "segment_index": 0, "shelf_index_x": 3, "shelf_index_y": 4 },
    { "x": 18.43, "y": 64.89, "z": 0, "upc": "000000000004", "depth": 18, "width": 3.7,   "height": 9.69,  "dFacings": 1, "excluded": false, "hFacings": 1, "vFacings": 1, "StackIndex": 0, "locationId": "3",  "orientation": "front_back", "segment_index": 0, "shelf_index_x": 5, "shelf_index_y": 4 },
    { "x": 22.05, "y": 64.89, "z": 0, "upc": "000000000010", "depth": 18, "width": 7.44,  "height": 9.61,  "dFacings": 1, "excluded": false, "hFacings": 2, "vFacings": 1, "StackIndex": 0, "locationId": "4",  "orientation": "front_back", "segment_index": 0, "shelf_index_x": 6, "shelf_index_y": 4 }
  ]
},
  "created_at": "1774989105",
  "updated_at": "21774989105"
}
```

  **Errors**

  All error responses for this endpoint return `{"message": "<error_message>"}`.

  - `400`: `companyId invalid or not provided`
  - `401`: `no token provided` — missing `Authorization: Bearer {api_key}` header
  - `401`: `unauthorized` — API key is invalid or does not match the company
  - `401`: `API key could not be validated, please try again later`
  - `403`: `unauthorized` — JWT grant type is not permitted for this endpoint
  - `403`: `company does not have access to this feature` — company is not enabled for planograms
  - `404`: `Planogram not found` — no planogram exists with this `external_id` for this company
  - `500`: internal error retrieving the planogram or signing the file URL




# Webhooks
## Planogram Processed Webhook
**Description** 
The planogram processed webhook is triggered after a planogram you submitted finishes processing, regardless of whether processing succeeded or failed. A webhook will only be sent if there is a subscription to this event.

By the time the webhook is sent, the planogram will be available via the External API planogram endpoints. Product matching runs only when the planogram is associated with an IR configuration; until then, products are returned as unmatched.

The external_id returned in the payload matches the external_id you provided when submitting the planogram, allowing you to correlate the result with your original request and fetch the planogram via the External API.

**Body**
```
{
    "event_type": "planogram_processed",
    "payload": {
      "status": string, # "successful" or "failed"
      "external_id": string,
      "completed_at": string, # ISO 8601 timestamp, UTC
      "company_id": int64,
      "error": string # only present when status is "failed"
    }
}
```

**Example Success Payload**
```
{
    "event_type": "planogram_processed",
    "payload": {
      "status": "successful",
      "external_id": "f3e2a1b4-7c9d-4e5f-a8b2-1d2c3e4f5a6b",
      "company_id": 4157,
      "completed_at": "2026-05-27T14:23:11.482Z"
    }
}
```
**Example Failure Payload**
```
{
    "event_type": "planogram_processed",
    "payload": {
      "status": "failed",
      "external_id": "f3e2a1b4-7c9d-4e5f-a8b2-1d2c3e4f5a6b",
      "company_id": 4157,
      "completed_at": "2026-05-27T14:23:11.482Z",
      "error": "planogram processing failed"
    }
}
```


# v2 Products
<a id="v2-products"></a>
The v2 endpoints for products


## Get Products by GUID [GET]
  **Description** 
  This endpoint allows you to get the information of one or many products by GUID

  **Url:** `/external/v2/companies/:company_id/products?guids=:guids&catalog_key=:catalog_key`

  **Request Body**
```
N/A
```

**Required:**

  - `company_id`: The id of the company the products belong to.
  - `guids`: A comma separated list of up to 50 product GUIDs.
  - `catalog_key`: The key of the catalog the products belong to.

**Example Url**
```
api.gospotcheck.com/external/v2/companies/2/products?guids=84250546-1c0d-47dd-b2df-c7d1898a2cbe,3b3d0325-997d-4d62-8dfe-ceacc5cbc5e4&catalog_key=my_catalog
```
**Parameters**

  - `products`: List of products.

**Return Body**
```
{
    "products": [
        {
            "guid": string,
            "upc": string,
            "name": string,
            "pack_type": string,
            "pack_size": string,
            "size": string,
            "brand": {
                "name": string
            },
            "brand_family": {
                "name": string
            },
            "subclassification": {
                "name": string
            },
            "classification": {
                "name": string
            },
            "supplier": {
                "name": string
            },
            "dimensions": {
                "depth_mm": float,
                "height_mm": float,
                "width_mm": float,
                "depth_inch": float,
                "height_inch": float,
                "width_inch": float
            }
        },
   ...
}
```
  
**Return Example Body**
