## Get Products by Catalog Key [GET]
  **Description** 
  This endpoint allows you to get the information of products from a specific catalog

  **Url:**
  ```
  /external/v2/companies/:company_id/products/catalogs/:catalog_key?limit=25&updated_at_min=1775490244&updated_at_max=1775493244page_token=eyJwYWY2NSwiZTE3Y2VWU3ZDFjNGQwYTMyIl19
  ```

  **Request Body**
```
N/A
```

**Required:**

 - `company_id`: The id of the company the products belong to.
 - `catalog_key`: The key of the catalog the products belong to.
  
**Optional:**

 - `limit`: The maximum number of products to return. Limited to 50 per page.
 - `page_token`: Pagination token used to retrieve the next page of results.
 - `updated_at_min`: Filters products updated at or after this date. Timestamp in Unix seconds.
 - `updated_at_max`: Filters products updated at or before this date. Timestamp in Unix seconds.
  
**Example Url**
```
api.gospotcheck.com/external/v2/companies/2/products/catalogs/my_catalog?limit=3&updated_at_min=1775490244&updated_at_max=1775493244&page_token=eyJwYWdlX3NpemUiOjUwLCJzb3J0IjWZjLWFkN2ItNTNjZGRjMzc1YzliIl19
```
**Parameters**

 - `products`: List of products.
 - `next_page_token`: Pagination token used to retrieve the next page of results.
 - `total_count`: Total count of products in the result set. If no filters are passed to the query, this will represent the total count of products in the catalog.

**Return Body**
```
{
    "products": [
        {
            "guid": string,
            "upc": string,
            "name": string,
            "pack_type": string,
            "pack_size": string,
            "size": string,
            "brand": {
                "name": string
            },
            "brand_family": {
                "name": string
            },
            "subclassification": {
                "name": string
            },
            "classification": {
                "name": string
            },
            "supplier": {
                "name": string
            },
            "dimensions": {
                "depth_mm": float,
                "height_mm": float,
                "width_mm": float,
                "depth_inch": float,
                "height_inch": float,
                "width_inch": float
            }
            "updated_at": int
        },
   ...
   ],
   "next_page_token": string,
   "total_count": int
}
```
  
**Return Example Body**
```
{
    "products": [
        {
            "guid": "84250546-1c0d-47dd-b2df-c7d1898a2cbe",
            "upc": "123",
